{"title":"Dwarf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 1 Human that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=1\">Lv 1</a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/dwarf?lv=1\" title=\"Pick level 1\"><td><b>1</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>12</td><td>1.5</td><td>50</td><td class=\"muted\">36 · 2.1 · 150</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/dwarf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dwarf\" data-map-level=\"30\">Show level 30 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(88.0px,75.6px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/-1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:-256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/0/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:0px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:-88.0px;top:-75.6px\"></i></div><figcaption>Binxonia</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Binxonia\">Binxonia</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"dwarf\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/dwarf-envoy\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Dwarf Envoy</b><span>Lv 30</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Human: <a href=\"#/monster/human\">Human</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/elf\">Elf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(1)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/stonegaze-cultist\">Stonegaze Cultist</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cult-hierophant\">Hierophant</a> <span class=\"muted\">(22)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/cult-sculptor\">Sculptor</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/82f2f368b69ecec68fbb.webp\" alt=\"Dwarf\"></div><h3>Dwarf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 1)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Human</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>118</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>21</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,500</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.8 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}